     under test, index.php = the framed-report test double in this folder. The real
     main.css is loaded on a dark theme so the filter box's computed styles are
     checked against the blanket per-theme button rules. -->
<div id="dashApp" class="dash-app"><header class="dash-head" id="dashHead">
  <div class="dash-head-title" id="dashHeadTitle"></div>
  <div class="dash-head-actions" id="dashHeadActions"></div>
